---

<Layout title="Session 115 — Tales of the Radiant Citadel" description="The party split into two teams and executed an impossible plan: Sundr and Haru bluffed their way into the God Brain's chamber, Sundr insulted an elder god ">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <a href="/studio" class="text-sm text-earth hover:text-ink transition-colors mb-6 inline-block">&larr; Studio</a>

    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black leading-tight mb-2">
      Session 115
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-earth mb-1">Tales of the Radiant Citadel &middot; September 29, 2026</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-light mb-8">Bluetspur Expedition (Conclusion)</p>

    <div class="prose-section text-ink-light leading-relaxed mb-12 space-y-4">
      <p>
        The party split into two teams and executed an impossible plan: Sundr and Haru bluffed their way into the God Brain's chamber, Sundr insulted an elder god until it wanted him dead, and then deliberately allowed a mind flayer to eat his brain — delivering the Bad Thought that would destroy the God Brain's entire faction. Meanwhile Toven, Kiet, and Virgil held the back cave, dispatched a corrupted troll abomination (through honor, not violence), and Toven seized control of the God Brain's own radiation storm as it died. Sundr died completing his mission. His spirit crossed to the Sunweaver's embrace, at peace. The God Brain's faction falls like wheat before the scythe.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Highlights</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-ink-light leading-relaxed space-y-2 mb-12 list-disc list-inside">
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The Plan (Recap for Eric)</strong> — Sam recaps: the party found the Bad Thought in the High Master's lab, Sundr plugged it into his own skull. Plan: Haru and Sundr go in as &quot;emissaries,&quot; Haru talks them past the guards, Sundr taunts the Elder Brain until a mind flayer eats his brain in irritation, Bad Thought infects from there.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The Chamber</strong> — Sam: *&quot;As you arrive, you see it. In a great pulsating chamber, in a pool of mucus, a massive brain.&quot;*</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Necrotic Shroud — Eyes Go Dark</strong> — Sundr activates Celestial Revelation (Necrotic Shroud): eyes become pools of darkness, flightless wings sprout, Fear DC 19.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The Double-1 Wisdom Save</strong> — Elder Brain tries to dominate Sundr. Sundr burns Lucky for advantage and has Bless running.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Intimidating a God (Roll: 34)</strong> — Sundr burns Bardic Inspiration (d8) on top of advantage and Lucky: final roll **34**.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Solar Storm — Chain Lightning on an Elder God</strong> — Sundr casts Solar Storm (radiant, Empowered metamagic). Elder Brain rolls a bad Dexterity save.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Haru Summons a Dragon</strong> — Haru casts Summon Draconic Spirit. Dragon immediately breathes a cone across two mind flayers and glances the Elder Brain.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The Curious Mind Flayer</strong> — A mind flayer has been drawn by all the Sunweaver-taunting. It floats closer, curious — it wants to eat Sundr's brain to extract the information about this &quot;minor god.&quot;</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The Bad Thought Spreads</strong> — The infected mind flayer immediately collapses, frothing at the mouth.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Haru Stabs the Brain (&quot;I'm Helping&quot;)</strong> — Elder Brain tries to dominate Haru: Wisdom save **29** (nat 20). Fails.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The Troll of the Back Cave</strong> — B-team (Toven, Kiet, Virgil) camping outside. Toven casts Commune with Nature.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The Troll Walks Out to Die</strong> — Troll, conceding its dishonorable state but finding a final argument: *&quot;You travel with a being who uses dishonorable fire. If you were not so dishonorable yourself, this would have been an issue. But you're a disgrace. End your life now — dishonor is a sliding scale — and regain one fragment of your honor.&quot;*</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Toven Steals the Storm</strong> — Toven casts Call Lightning. The storm belongs to the Elder Brain — but with it distracted, panicking, and dying, Toven seizes control.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Sundr in the Sunweaver's Embrace</strong> — Sundr drifts between life and death. The Sunweaver speaks.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">The Mission Succeeds</strong> — Sam: *&quot;Exponentially, the mind flayers that followed the god brain will be infected with the bad thought and will fall like wheat before the scythe. And you have taken out one of the two mind flayer factions on this planet.&quot;*</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Art</h2>
    <div class="space-y-10">
      {images.map((img) => (
        <figure>
          <img
            src={img.src}
            alt={img.title}
            class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-lg"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption class="mt-3">
            <span class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm">{img.title}</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-light mt-1">{img.caption}</p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-cream-dark mt-16 pt-8">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-3">Party</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm">
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Sundr</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Erik) — Aasimar Sorcerer</span></div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Kiet</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Jonas) — Dragonborn Fighter</span></div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Virgil Gemnar</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Kyle) — Goliath Barbarian</span></div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Toven</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Max) — Druid</span></div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Haru</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Hunter) — Kobold Paladin</span></div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-ink">DM</span> <span class="text-ink-light">(Sam)</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
